# Agent session machinery: share the hooks config, the skills and the commands;
# keep the rest of .claude/ local.
#
# CtxPack memory is LOCAL by default. Raw session records, gists and the
# checkpoint ledger carry machine-specific absolute paths, verbatim prompts and
# cross-repository working context, so a blanket `!.claude/ctx/` makes every new
# session tracked-by-default and publishes the operator rather than the product.
# Only .claude/ctx/public/ — a deliberately authored, sanitized projection — is
# shared. See the engine's docs/decisions/0004-ctxpack-memory-scopes.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/ctx/
.claude/ctx/*
!.claude/ctx/public/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/

